
  tinywin 1.0 — lean desktop for the CX22NA

  Everything you need is in the Start menu (bottom left):
    Install app · Updates · Themes · Get apps · System info · File manager

  Handy commands
    tinywin-install <file>   install a .deb / .AppImage / .zip / .tar
    tinywin-update           system updates (no background daemons)
    tinywin-theme            change theme, icons, wallpaper
    tinywin-growroot         fill the disk with the root filesystem
    tinywin-info --text      RAM, disk, network, processes

